    "description": "Wildline is a small tech team that specializes in designing, building, and maintaining web and mobile apps for a variety of businesses. I am involved in every step of the development process.  This includes meeting with clients to help guide them through the design and ideation stage, as well as front-end focused coding of new features, and maintenance of live apps using CI/CD implementation of patches and version updates. I am currently involved in several projects all in various stages of development, including a financial tracking and expenses app which is live in Australia, New Zealand, and the US. Through the utilization of agile methodologies, I am able to effectively balance the development and maintenance of a production application, with ongoing client requirements and feedback discussions. React Native and Typescript are the primary languages I use for our projects as well as a variety of design, VCS, CRM, and DevOps toolsets.",
